# Balemurk Leech: "Eerie - Whenever an enchantment you control enters and whenever you fully unlock a Room, each opponent
# loses 1 life." Bot1 casts the Leech in turn 1 (a creature, not an enchantment: no trigger). In turn 2 Bot2 casts a Bad Moon,
# an enchantment under the opponent's control, so the Leech triggers nothing and both players stay at 20. In turn 3 Bot1 casts
# its own Bad Moon (CR 603.6a): the trigger resolves and Bot2 loses exactly 1 life, Bot1 none.

